+- [x] Exact source links and locators: pages27/29/31, raw row labels, date context and production marks in SOURCE-PINS.json. No invented raster line numbers.
+- [x] Actual bounded reading: twenty images within cap, pages25–32 only; earlier13–18remain partial. Masks and faint details not recovered.
