+- [x] Missing originals and all five tracks/eighteen requirements retained as open/partial; no raw-data or scientific test claimed.
+- [x] Revision accountability: immediate predecessor absent; TEXT-CHANGES.diff is the actual addition diff, separate from visual source reading.
